---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout pageId="impact">
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container page-hero__grid">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">First-year plan</span><h1>The 2026–27 roadmap.</h1><p class="page-hero__lead">This page tracks membership recruitment, the first meeting, project selection, the first event, and the first-term report.</p></div>
    <div class="page-hero__side"><figure class="page-hero__figure"><img src="assets/images/photos/circuit-board-dark.jpg" width="1200" height="960" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" alt="A black circuit board on a dark background"></figure><aside class="page-hero__aside"><strong>Current stage</strong><p data-impact-stage>Founding stage</p><p>No public results have been reported yet.</p></aside></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Milestones</span><h2>Planned and completed work.</h2></div><p>Each item includes its date or term and status.</p></div>
    <div class="roadmap" data-roadmap aria-live="polite"><div class="empty-state"><h3>Loading roadmap…</h3><p>Preparing milestone information.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="container reading-width">
    <span class="eyebrow">Public record</span>
    <h2>No outcomes have been reported yet.</h2>
    <p>The society has not announced an event or completed a project. A dated report will be added after the first confirmed activity.</p>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
